# Accepted differences between the SDL backend and the X11 reference,
# per test: the maximum number of differing image pixels (-1: any), and
# whether standard output may differ. Anything not listed must match
# exactly. See sdl/design.md, "Comparing with the X11 reference".
#
# name      pixels  output
clipcopy    30      same     # thin arc outline: X's arc algorithm
lines       10      same     # corner pixels of even-width line caps
shapes      60      same     # edge pixels of circles and slanted outlines
text        -1      differs  # different fonts: glyphs and metrics
